# PART 2 — FRONTEND ARCHITECTURE & USER INTERFACE SPECIFICATION

---

# 1. FRONTEND OBJECTIVE

The frontend is the Command Center.

The map is always the primary visualization component.

Everything else exists to:

* Filter map data
* Analyze map data
* Visualize map data
* Control map data

The map must never feel like a secondary widget.

